-- The takanon's root (MMS-521): every takanon provision that speaks to an
-- item of the shared vocabulary (l4/lib/vocabulary.l4), registered once as
-- an instrument, and what it claims for a case. The root (l4/lib/root.l4)
-- imports it beside the agreements' and the circulars' roots and leaves
-- precedence to l4/lib/precedence.l4.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT precedence
IMPORT terms
IMPORT `takanon-1-1`

§ `שורש התקנון — מה התקנון אומר על כל פריט`

§§ `תוספת 2008`

-- §1.1 says it was updated on 2.2.2010: that is its date for the takanon's
-- introduction, which lets an owners' circular prevail only if it is more
-- recent. Its rates are the State's, as practised for all state employees.
`the takanon §1.1` MEANS
    `instrument` WITH
        `module`        IS "takanon-1-1"
        `title`         IS "תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, סעיף 1.1ג"
        `kind`          IS `another source`
        `is the takanon` IS TRUE
        `issued`        IS DATE_FROM_DMY 2 2 2010
        `practised for all state employees` IS TRUE
        `approved by the Finance Minister`  IS FALSE

`the takanon's 2008 provision was last amended` MEANS `the takanon §1.1`'s `issued`

GIVEN c IS A `2008 supplement case`
GIVETH A LIST OF `claim`
DECIDE `the takanon's claims on the 2008 supplement` c IS
    catMaybes (LIST `the claim of` `the takanon §1.1` (`the 2008 supplement according to the takanon` c))

-- Every instrument this root registers, for the root's report.
`the takanon's instruments` MEANS LIST `the takanon §1.1`
